@Investigacion1_HostAddress = http://localhost:5208

GET {{Investigacion1_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{Investigacion1_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan Perez",
  "email": "juan@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

POST {{Investigacion1_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###
### Login como admin de prueba (credenciales del equipo)

POST {{Investigacion1_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dra.garcia@dermovita.com",
  "password": "Garcia123"
}

### Crear servicio (solo Admin/Dermatólogo)

POST {{Investigacion1_HostAddress}}/servicios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "Consulta general",
  "duracionMinutos": 30,
  "precio": 25000
}

### Historial de un paciente (Admin ve cualquiera; Paciente solo el propio)

GET {{Investigacion1_HostAddress}}/pacientes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/historial
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rutas Admin de gestión de suscripción (solo Admin)

PATCH {{Investigacion1_HostAddress}}/users/1/is-active
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "isActive": false
}

###

PATCH {{Investigacion1_HostAddress}}/users/1/subscription-expiration
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "subscriptionExpirationDate": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}
